## Environment variables for the frontend application
## Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values
VITE_API_URL=https://local.api.application-tracker.lucassenarj.dev

## Google Analytics Measurement ID
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=your-ga-measurement-id

## Sentry DSN for error tracking
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=your-sentry-dsn

## SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN is intentionally NOT set here -- it's a build-time-only
## secret for @sentry/vite-plugin's source map upload, and must be set as an
## environment variable on whatever platform runs the production build
## (currently Vercel). See vite.config.ts and DECISIONS.md.